  {
    "id": 3016002010030,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "……ふふ、今日はちょっとおねむさんなのね？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301600201/3016002010030"
  },
  {
    "id": 3016002010040,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "うん。お仕事の前に宿題終わらせちゃおう！\r\nって思ったんだけど……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301600201/3016002010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 3016002010050,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "思ったよりたくさんあって、いっぱい頭使っちゃったから\r\nなんか眠くなっちゃったんだー",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301600201/3016002010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 3016002010060,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "そっかぁ\r\n両立は大変だよね",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301600201/3016002010060"
  },
  {
    "id": 3016002010070,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "うん。こういう時は少しだけお休みしたいなーとか\r\n思っちゃうけど、この後お仕事あるから！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301600201/3016002010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 3016002010080,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "じゃあ、思いきって仮眠を取っちゃうのはどう？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301600201/3016002010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 3016002010090,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えー、でも甘奈、起きられるかな……\r\nちょっと寝過ごしちゃいそうで怖いかも",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301600201/3016002010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 3016002010100,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "そのときは私が起こしてあげるから\r\nほら、甘奈ちゃんはソファを使って",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301600201/3016002010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 3016002010110,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ほんとー！　千雪さん、ありがと！\r\nちょっと休んだら、甘奈、大丈夫そうな気がする",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/301600201/3016002010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 3016002010120,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "そう？　じゃ、クッションを枕にしてね\r\nブランケットも持ってくるから",
